<title>USA: Industrial Data to buy Design Automation.</title>
<headline>Industrial Data to buy Design Automation.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Data Systems Corp said Monday that it signed a letter of intent to acquire Design Automation Systems in a cash and stock transaction valued at $12.5 million.</p>
<p>Industrial Data said this proposed acquisition will approximately triple its revenues and is projected to be accretive to the company's per share earnings.</p>
